            <executionModel>
    		<initialization>
        	    Example Project mode supports automatic component lifecycle management.
        	    Expert mode requires application-managed initialization, startup, shutdown, and resource management.
    		</initialization>
    		<runtimeBehavior>
        	    Event sources trigger timestamp capture.
        	    Events are buffered and processed asynchronously.
        	    Formatted log entries are transmitted through a shared UART interface.
